course: dictionary
lesson: 10739
title: The upside of upside down
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: One word can have more than one meaning, and the sentence tells you which one you need. «Bats sleep hanging upside down» means the top is at the bottom. Look at the words around the word, and they will show you the meaning.
explain: «The room was turned upside down» is different. It means in a big mess, not that the room is standing on its head. Ask yourself: does the picture make sense? If not, try the other meaning.
explain: The upside is a noun, and it means the good side of something that is mostly bad. If Mum says the upside of the rain is that the garden gets watered, she means the good part of a wet day.
fact: Upside down means with the top at the bottom and the bottom at the top.
fact: «The room was turned upside down» means in a big mess.
fact: The upside is the good side of something that is mostly bad.
fact: «A flamingo feeds with its head upside down in the water» uses the first meaning: its head is really the wrong way up.
fact: In maths, turning a shape or number upside down is a half turn, so 6 upside down looks like 9.
exercise: «Bats sleep hanging upside down.» What does upside down mean here? | In a big mess | Fast, like a roller coaster | *With the top at the bottom and the bottom at the top | The good side of something bad
exercise: «The room was turned upside down.» What does upside down mean here? | *In a big mess | Standing on its head | Very quiet | Full of light
exercise: Mum says, «The upside of the rain is that the garden gets watered.» What does the upside mean? | A quick run in the rain | A bad part of a plan | *The good side of something that is mostly bad | The top side of a page
test: «A flamingo feeds with its head upside down in the water.» Does upside down mean in a mess here? | Yes, it means happy | Yes, the flamingo is in a mess | *No, it means the top is at the bottom
test: A 6 turned upside down looks like which number? | 1 | *9 | 4
exam: «The lens in the eye makes an upside-down picture on the retina, and the brain turns it the right way up.» What does upside-down mean in this sentence? | Glowing and bright | Full of mess | *With the top at the bottom | Very tired
